OL,3,AUK drone factories may face attacks
OL,4,Afrom 'unknown sources', says Kremlin
OL,5,Aadviser
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn an interview with Bloomberg, Burnham
OL,8,Fsaid, "I'm looking forward to going to
OL,9,FNew York in September," when the UN
OL,10,FGeneral Assembly will meet.
OL,12,FHe said that while the details were not
OL,13,F"fully confirmed", it is "likely" he
OL,14,Fwill go. The trip would be his first to
OL,15,Fthe US since becoming prime minister in
OL,16,FJuly.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
