OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMore than 70,000 social and affordable
OL,4,Ahomes to be built across England over
OL,5,A10 years
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is the first part of a wider plan to
OL,8,Fbuild 300,000 social and affordable
OL,9,Fhomes across the nation, under the
OL,10,Fgovernment's #39bn social housebuilding
OL,11,Fprogramme.
OL,13,FEarlier this year, before he became
OL,14,Fprime minister, Andy Burnham had called
OL,15,Ffor the entire 10-year #39bn affordable
OL,16,Fhousing budget for England to be spent
OL,17,Fon homes for social rent.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
